			<item>
				<title>Why Brick Expressionism?</title>
				<link>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/fuenf-jahre-wesermuende/manifest.json</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2020 20:25:07 +0200</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/fuenf-jahre-wesermuende/manifest.json</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;To find out how one comes to run a blog on &amp;ldquo;&lt;img src=&#34;https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/images/header.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Backsteinexpressionismus&#34; class=&#34;inline-title&#34;&gt;&amp;rdquo;, we have to travel far back into my past:&#xA;Sometime in childhood, in the first half of the 80s, I was regularly driven through Wulsdorf, a district of Bremerhaven. Always the same route, always on the way into &amp;ldquo;town&amp;rdquo;. Maybe to the grandparents or to go shopping, I can no longer say exactly where.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
